<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Helping Hands</title>

    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4fff5;
            color: #333;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #176b45;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        nav {
            background-color: #104d33;
            padding: 16px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 15px;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #ffe082;
        }

        .banner {
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #d9f5df;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        .banner h2 {
            color: #176b45;
            font-size: 30px;
        }

        button {
            background-color: #e68a24;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        button:hover {
            background-color: #bd6410;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #176b45;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .cards {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 20px;
            padding: 25px;
        }

        .card {
            background: white;
            width: 250px;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 12px;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 10px #c7dfcd;
        }

        .icon {
            font-size: 50px;
        }

        section {
            padding: 20px;
        }

        table {
            width: 85%;
            margin: 20px auto;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            background: white;
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 12px;
            border: 1px solid #a5c9ad;
            text-align: left;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #176b45;
            color: white;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #104d33;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 18px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            nav a {
                display: inline-block;
                margin: 8px;
            }

            table {
                width: 100%;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header>
        <h1>🤝 HELPING HANDS</h1>
        <p>Small Acts. Big Changes.</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#activities">Activities</a>
        <a href="#reports">Reports</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="banner" id="home">
        <h2>Together, We Can Make a Difference</h2>
        <p>Working towards a kinder, healthier and happier community.</p>
        <a href="#activities">
            <button>Explore Our Work</button>
        </a>
    </div>

    <section id="about">
        <h2>About Our Project</h2>
        <p style="text-align:center; max-width:800px; margin:auto;">
            Helping Hands is a community service project focused on
            supporting people in need. Our activities include food
            donation, educational support and environmental cleanliness.
            Our goal is to encourage kindness and social responsibility.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="activities">
        <h2>Our Activities</h2>

        <div class="cards">
            <div class="card">
                <div class="icon">🍱</div>
                <h3>Food Donation</h3>
                <p>Collecting and distributing food to people in need.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="icon">📚</div>
                <h3>Education Support</h3>
                <p>Sharing books and learning materials with students.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="card">
                <div class="icon">🌱</div>
                <h3>Green Community</h3>
                <p>Organizing tree planting and cleanliness activities.</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="reports">
        <h2>Project Timeline and Reports</h2>

        <table>
            <tr>
                <th>Week</th>
                <th>Activity</th>
                <th>Expected Outcome</th>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Week 1</td>
                <td>Community survey</td>
                <td>Identify local needs</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Week 2</td>
                <td>Food collection</td>
                <td>Gather donated food</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Week 3</td>
                <td>Distribution drive</td>
                <td>Support local families</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
                <td>Week 4</td>
                <td>Project review</td>
                <td>Evaluate the results</td>
            </tr>
        </table>

        <p style="text-align:center;">
            These are planned activities and expected outcomes.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section id="contact" style="text-align:center;">
        <h2>Get Involved</h2>
        <p>Want to support our community project?</p>
        <p>Email: helpinghands@example.com</p>
        <p>Phone: 9876543210</p>
        <button onclick="alert('Thank you for your interest in Helping Hands!')">
            Volunteer Interest
        </button>
    </section>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Helping Hands Community Project</p>
        <p>Serve Others. Spread Happiness.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
